  "description": "NINLED crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H172 Dy8 N16 O40,8(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.712-3.841 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.57-114.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(LH2)4(μ-Piv)4(η2-Piv)4(μ-OMe)4]·8CH3OH.",
